@startuml User_Journey_Regular_Practice
!theme blueprint
title Cramer CMS - Regular Practice Journey\n(Weekly Study Routine)

skinparam {
    BackgroundColor #1a1a2e
    TitleFontColor #ffffff
    TitleFontSize 18
    DefaultFontColor #e8e8e8
    ArrowColor #64b5f6
    NoteBackgroundColor #424242
    NoteFontColor #ffffff
    ActivityBackgroundColor #37474f
    ActivityBorderColor #78909c
}

|#2c3e50|Weekly Study Plan|
start
:Student has IELTS exam in 6 weeks;
note right
  **Study Goal:**
  - 3 full tests per week
  - Focus on weak skills
  - Target: Band 7.0+
end note

:Opens Cramer on Monday evening;
:Logs in (remembered session);

|#34495e|Dashboard Review|
:Lands on Dashboard;
:Checks progress chart;
note right
  **Current Stats:**
  - Reading: 7.0 avg
  - Listening: 6.5 avg
  - Writing: 6.0 avg (needs work)
  - 15 tests completed
end note

:Reviews recent attempts;
:Sees skill analysis breakdown;
:Identifies: Listening needs focus;

|#3498db|Day 1: Listening Focus|
:Navigates to Courses;
:Selects Cambridge 15 (new);
:Starts Listening Test 2;

:Puts on headphones;
:Enables Autoplay toggle;
:Listens to Part 1 audio;
:Answers 10 questions;

:Moves through Parts 2, 3, 4;
:40 questions in 30 minutes;
:Submits test;

:Reviews results: 34/40 (Band 7.5);
:Checks wrong answers in Part 3;
:Realizes: Matching questions are weak;

|#9b59b6|Day 2: Reading Practice|
:Returns next day;
:Dashboard shows yesterday's attempt;
:Starts Reading Test 3;

:Uses text highlighting feature;
:Highlights key paragraphs;
:Answers question groups;

:Clicks word, sees popup;
:Adds "ubiquitous" to vocabulary;
:Continues test;

:Submits: 36/40 (Band 8.0);
:Satisfied with progress;

|#f39c12|Day 3: Writing with AI|
:Selects Writing test;
:Has 2 AI gradings left;
:Decides to use one today;

:Completes Task 1 and Task 2;
:Submits for AI grading;
:Reviews detailed feedback;

:Band 6.5 overall;
note right
  **Improvement Noted:**
  - Up from 6.0 last week
  - Grammar improved
  - Still needs vocabulary work
end note

:Saves sample essay for reference;

|#27ae60|End of Week: Progress Check|
:Opens Dashboard on Sunday;
:Views weekly summary;

:Progress Chart shows:
- Listening: 6.5 -> 7.5
- Reading: stable at 7.5
- Writing: 6.0 -> 6.5;

:Checks quota usage:
- 14/20 Reading used
- 12/20 Listening used
- 3/5 AI gradings used;

:Plans next week:
- More Writing practice
- Focus on Task 2 structure;

|#1abc9c|Vocabulary Building|
:Navigates to Vocabulary page;
:Reviews 23 saved words;
:Toggles cards to study;
:Marks 5 as "Mastered";

:Uses AI translation for new word;
:Costs 1 Lua for translation;
:Gets phonetic + examples;

|#e74c3c|Approaching Exam|
if (4 weeks to exam?) then (yes)
  :Increases intensity;
  :2 tests per day;
  :Running low on quota;
  :Upgrades to Cramerous;
else (no)
  :Maintains routine;
  :Steady improvement;
endif

:Continues weekly cycle;
stop

legend right
  **Weekly Routine:**
  |= Day |= Activity |= Time |
  | Monday | Listening | 45 min |
  | Tuesday | Reading | 60 min |
  | Wednesday | Writing | 90 min |
  | Thursday | Listening | 45 min |
  | Friday | Reading | 60 min |
  | Saturday | Writing | 90 min |
  | Sunday | Review | 30 min |
endlegend

@enduml
